# Build context for server/Dockerfile (context = server/). Files the binaries
# never read are kept out so a test-only change does not produce a new image
# digest and roll out uniwork-be for nothing.
# Keep every //go:embed source: internal/mail/templates, migrations/*.sql,
# internal/service/reserved_slugs.json.

**/*_test.go
**/testdata
coverage.floor
*.out
sqlc.yaml

# Local builds, caches and upload storage
bin
data
internal/handler/data
.go-cache
.go-tmp
*.exe

# Secrets and local env
**/.env
**/.env.*
